spans.s:
Vilambā,
(1) n. of a rākṣasī: SP 〔400.4〕 (Burnouf [] Pralambā, citing a var. Vilambā; two mss. reported in KN as reading first Vilambā, then Pralambā);
(2) n. of a piśācī: Māy 〔238.19〕.

vilohita, nt.,
(1) blood (? = Skt. lohita): Śikṣ 〔81.14〕 (vs) vṛkkau vilohitaṃ pittaṃ, in a list of parts of the body. The alternative would seem to be to take vi = (a)pi, with Prakritic v. for p; I do not think this likely;
(2) -saṃjñā = vilohitaka-, q.v.: ŚsP 〔59.8〕.
